  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Fix Json db losing already saved pasta's on crash/power failure by @yara-blue in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/281\r\n* Adds a feature no-c-deps which makes microbin easy to crosscompile by @yara-blue in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/279\r\n* Upgrade deps by @Timshel in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/254\r\n* Updates dependencies by @yara-blue in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/280\r\n* MICROBIN_UPLOADER_PASSWORD was missing from compose.yaml by @secondubly in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/228\r\n* Fix default value comments for some environment variables by @isaacasensio in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/268\r\n* Fix never expire condition by @runofthemillgeek in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/260\r\n* Fix privacyDropdown is null issue by @luochen1990 in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/267\r\n* Awnser Range requests and stream files downloads by @yara-blue in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/277\r\n* Set charset=utf-8 for /raw/{id} response by @luk1337 in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/246\r\n* Attachments compatible with absolute path by @Timshel in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/255\r\n* fix: division by zero on 32-bit platform (#107, #118) by @jixunmoe in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/239\r\n* Minor fixups by @luk1337 in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/211\r\n* Update broken documentation link by @fastfailures in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/203\r\n* Fix MICROBIN_ETERNAL_PASTA by @SouthFox-D in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/215\r\n* Prefix some URLs with args.public_path_as_str() by @PeterUpfold in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/194\r\n* Make QR code as short as possible by @swwind in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/285\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @Timshel made their first contribution in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/254\r\n* @secondubly made their first contribution in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/228\r\n* @isaacasensio made their first contribution in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/268\r\n* @runofthemillgeek made their first contribution in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/260\r\n* @luochen1990 made their first contribution in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/267\r\n* @luk1337 made their first contribution in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/246\r\n* @jixunmoe made their first contribution in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/239\r\n* @fastfailures made their first contribution in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/203\r\n* @SouthFox-D made their first contribution in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/215\r\n* @PeterUpfold made their first contribution in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/194\r\n* @swwind made their first contribution in https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/pull/285\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/szabodanika/microbin/compare/v2.0.4...v2.1.0",
